OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786411079
OL,3,CGovernment should ease energy policy
OL,4,Ccosts for 'concerned' businesses, says
OL,5,CE.On
OL,7,FResearch from the company indicated
OL,8,Fthat many UK businesses are keen to
OL,9,Finvest in low-carbon technology but
OL,10,Fare put off by the costs involved.
OL,12,FE.On said it believes UK manufacturers
OL,13,Fcould save more than #2 billion by
OL,14,F2035 by switching away from gas and
OL,15,Fscaling up clean energy technology.
OL,17,FAnalysis from the group's ReIndustrial
OL,18,FRevolution indicates that UK companies
OL,19,Fcan benefit in the longer-term from
OL,20,Fgreen energy investments.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786411079
OL,3,CGovernment should ease energy policy
OL,4,Ccosts for 'concerned' businesses, says
OL,5,CE.On
OL,7,FMr Norbury told the Press Association
OL,8,Fthat the recent move by Andy Burnham's
OL,9,Fgovernment to remove VAT from consumer
OL,10,Felectricity bills shows that ministers
OL,11,Fare "moving in the right direction".
OL,13,F"We hope it shows there is an overall
OL,14,Fdirection of travel within Government
OL,15,Fabout the positives that
OL,16,Felectrification can bring," he said.
OL,26,@sD@EOUsD@cO]uD@AOUxD@[O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/6
