SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786411079
OL,3,CGovernment should ease energy policy
OL,4,Ccosts for 'concerned' businesses, says
OL,5,CE.On
OL,7,FHe said he had already spoken to
OL,8,FEnergy Secretary Miatta Fahnbulleh,
OL,9,Fhighlighting that the supplier has a
OL,10,F"positive and constructive"
OL,11,Frelationship with government.
OL,13,FNevertheless, Mr Norbury said business
OL,14,Fcustomers are keen to see supportive
OL,15,Fenergy policies and a stable backdrop
OL,16,Ffor investment.
OL,26,@rD@AOUrD@[O]
