OL,3,CGovernment should ease energy policy
OL,4,Ccosts for 'concerned' businesses, says
OL,5,CE.On
OL,7,FE.On has agreed to buy rival Ovo in a
OL,8,Fdeal which would create Britain's
OL,9,Flargest supplier.
OL,11,FThe deal, which still needs to secure
OL,12,Fregulatory approval, would create a
OL,13,Fcombined business serving about 9.6
OL,14,Fmillion customers.
